# Scratch / screenshot scripts
#
# Probes written to MEASURE something in a browser and then thrown away. They
# are not the sweep: `scripts/ui-sweep.mjs` is the load-bearing one, it exits
# non-zero, and it is the only browser script that belongs in a commit. These
# patterns carry no slash, so they match at any depth — `scripts/_audit-x.mjs`
# included.
_shot.mjs
_scratch*
_probe*
_audit*
.probe/
.partner-src/
